THIRD-PARTY DATA AND CODE ATTRIBUTION

This repository aggregates data and tools from the following sources.
Their licenses and terms of use apply to the respective data and code:

1. antifilter.download (https://antifilter.download)
   - Used for: `ru-blocked` category (blocked subnets/IPs in Russia).
   - Data is provided by the antifilter project; check the site for terms.

2. hxehex/russia-mobile-internet-whitelist
   (https://github.com/hxehex/russia-mobile-internet-whitelist)
   - Used for: `ru-whitelist` category.
   - Subject to that repository's license.

3. Loyalsoldier/geoip (https://github.com/Loyalsoldier/geoip)
   - Used for: base categories (cloudflare, cloudfront, facebook, fastly,
     google, netflix, telegram, twitter, ru) and GeoLite2-ASN CSV files.
   - Licensed under its repository license.

4. MaxMind GeoLite2 ASN (via Loyalsoldier CSV mirrors)
   - Used for: `ddos-guard` and `yandex` categories (ASN-based).
   - GeoLite2 data is licensed under the Creative Commons
     Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International License and the GeoLite2
     End User License Agreement:
     https://www.maxmind.com/en/geolite2/eula
     https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/

5. runetfreedom/geoip (https://github.com/runetfreedom/geoip)
   runetfreedom/geodat2srs (https://github.com/runetfreedom/geodat2srs)
   v2fly/geoip (https://github.com/v2fly/geoip)
   - Used for: build toolchain and GeoIP format ecosystem.
   - Each is subject to its own repository license (GPL-3.0 for v2fly/geoip
     and runetfreedom projects — build tools only, their license does not
     apply to the data output of this repository).
